---
source: crates/biome_css_analyze/tests/spec_tests.rs
expression: invalid.scss
---
# Input
```css
// should generate diagnostics
a { transition-duration: 80ms; }
a { transition: foo 0.008s linear; }
a { animation: foo 0.8s ease, bar 20ms ease; }
a { transition-duration: 10ms, 200ms; }

.card {
	&:hover {
		transition-delay: 0.05s;
	}
}

@mixin fade {
	animation: fade 50ms linear;
}

// Times that are part of a calculation are checked as written.
a { transition-duration: 10ms * 20; }
a { transition-duration: (10ms); }
a { transition-duration: $duration + 10ms; }
a { transition-duration: #{10ms}; }
a { transition-duration: math.div(10ms, 2); }

// Nested properties
a { transition: opacity 50ms { delay: 5ms; } }
a { transition: { duration: 10ms; delay: 20ms; } }
a { -webkit-animation: { delay: 30ms; } }
a { ANIMATION: { Duration: 40ms; } }

```

